{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07324","headline":"南楚怀古 · 刘长卿","name":"南楚怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国久芜没，我来空郁陶。\n君看章华宫，处处生蓬蒿。\n但见陵与谷，岂知贤与豪。\n精魂托古木，宝劒捐江臯。\n倚棹下晴景，回舟随晚涛。\n碧云暮寥落，湖上秋天高。\n往事那堪问，此心徒自劳。\n独余湘水上，千载闻离骚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}